well they're still pretty
traditional, right?

00:44:00.330 --> 00:44:03.133
Like we got married, we're still married.

00:44:03.970 --> 00:44:04.840
We, there's,
Yeah.

00:44:04.840 --> 00:44:06.473
There's a there, and so there you,

00:44:06.473 --> 00:44:08.860
there's sort of these
built-in expectations of like,

00:44:08.860 --> 00:44:11.690
