00:44:22.730 --> 00:44:23.820
Yeah.

00:44:23.820 --> 00:44:26.460
I think for me, it's an impulse,

00:44:26.460 --> 00:44:31.057
like to believe the
illusion that I can control

00:44:32.070 --> 00:44:35.040
their happiness, that
I do know what's best.

00:44:35.040 --> 00:44:38.500
I think when you taking
this big decision of like,

00:44:38.500 --> 00:44:42.880
going off to college or any big decision,

00:44:42.880 --> 00:44:44.290
or just any life decision.

00:44:44.290 --> 00:44:46.970
It's like, there's this illusion that

00:44:46.970 --> 00:44:49.080
you can make the right choice.

00:44:49.080 --> 00:44:51.290
You know, a lot of times it's that,

00:44:51.290 --> 00:44:53.120
that is just an illusion.

00:44:53.120 --> 00:44:54.250
It's more of like,

00:44:54.250 --> 00:44:57.040
or illusion that you can
have all the information

00:44:57.040 --> 00:44:58.810
that like makes it a mathematical,

00:44:58.810 --> 00:45:00.860
there's a mathematical solution.

00:45:00.860 --> 00:45:03.870
Like, I tend to believe that thing,

00:45:03.870 --> 00:45:05.590
and believe that in the back of my mind,

00:45:05.590 --> 00:45:06.423
about a lot of things.

00:45:06.423 --> 00:45:08.060
And when it comes to parenting, it's like,

00:45:08.060 --> 00:45:13.060
I can control their, I know
what's best for their happiness.

00:45:13.100 --> 00:45:16.400
But then realizing there's so, you know,

00:45:16.400 --> 00:45:20.227
we're making these decisions
based on limited information.

00:45:20.227 --> 00:45:23.030
And, so just saying, "You know what,

00:45:23.030 --> 00:45:26.170
I'm gonna do the best I can in my role."

00:45:26.170 --> 00:45:27.850
But it, and it,

00:45:27.850 --> 00:45:30.713
even if I think something's
the best thing to do,

00:45:31.610 --> 00:45:34.730
but I'm relinquishing
that decision to them.

00:45:34.730 --> 00:45:36.830
Even if they do something different.

00:45:36.830 --> 00:45:41.610
It's saying, "Okay, I'm
gonna lovingly detach,

00:45:41.610 --> 00:45:44.240
in a way that lets them go for it."

00:45:44.240 --> 00:45:45.073
Yeah.
You know,

